1
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,640
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,800
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,360
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:22,880
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,760
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:30,160
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,240
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,440
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,960
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:47,120
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,240
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,600
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,360
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,560
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,200
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,880
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,440
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,760
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,520
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:13,920
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:17,080
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:20,480
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,760
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:27,040
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:29,080
♪I travel north and south,
witnessing the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,560
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:36,160
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:39,640
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:42,000
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:45,760
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,880
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:53,000
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:57,080
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 5=

34
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:58,920
Oh...

35
00:01:58,920 --> 00:01:59,760
Master.

36
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:02,080
Why are we hiding here?

37
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:02,720
What for?

38
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:04,360
Oh, Mr. Huang...

39
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,920
Something's not right about him.

40
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,840
It's all because of you.

41
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:09,160
Oh.

42
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:11,400
He didn't even eat your pill,

43
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,240
and you were already asking
for donations.

44
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:14,560
Hey, Piaopiao,

45
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:15,400
weren't you the same?

46
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:17,600
- You were talking about Mr. Huang Jr...
- But at least I...

47
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:18,360
Hmm?

48
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,920
Who do you think you are looking
down on?

49
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:26,040
Master, give me half!

50
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:26,880
Get away.

51
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:27,400
Get away!

52
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:29,280
Get away. Get away.

53
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:30,120
Get away.

54
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:31,240
Hmm?

55
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:34,920
(Marriage Contest
Huang Residence)

56
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:35,720
Hey.

57
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,320
What's this?

58
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:43,040
Huh?

59
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:44,040
A marriage contest?

60
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:45,520
Think about it.

61
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:46,400
- Master,
- Huh?

62
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:48,360
Mr. Huang is so wealthy.

63
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,800
The betrothal gifts must
be generous, right?

64
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:50,680
Hmm.

65
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:52,200
How about...

66
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,280
I give it a try?

67
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:57,360
- You?
- With my beauty,

68
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,640
I can definitely make Mr. Huang Jr.

69
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:00,360
fall head over heels for me.

70
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,000
Hey, hey!

71
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,080
Are you mad?

72
00:03:02,320 --> 00:03:02,640
Hmm?

73
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:04,440
You're marrying a mortal for some money?

74
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,360
Am I supposed to just watch Master

75
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:09,360
get kicked out of Lingyin Temple
by that fat monk?

76
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:09,680
Hey...

77
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:10,200
Well...

78
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,200
Holy Monk, look at her.

79
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,880
After all, I'm your master.

80
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:15,760
I can't just let you do this.

81
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:16,560
- Hey.
- Right.

82
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:17,680
Master.

83
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,480
My plan is called

84
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:20,560
going undercover.

85
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:20,840
Hmm.

86
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:21,560
You said it yourself.

87
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:22,920
The Huang family is filled
with evil aura.

88
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:23,320
Right?

89
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:23,760
So,

90
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:26,240
if I marry Mr. Huang Jr.,

91
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,800
I'll infiltrate the Huang family

92
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,640
and get rid of their evil aura.

93
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:30,480
Hmm.

94
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:31,280
Won't they then give us

95
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,200
a fortune?

96
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:32,920
Right.

97
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:34,200
What we're doing

98
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:35,000
is called...

99
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:36,760
- doing good deeds and gaining virtue.
- Hmm.

100
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:37,280
Hey, Holy Monk!

101
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,120
It's not about the money.

102
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:38,520
Right?

103
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,040
Right. Right.

104
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:39,840
Do you want to go?

105
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,440
If you want to go, go yourselves.

106
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:42,360
I'm not going.

107
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:42,720
Hey.

108
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:43,760
Master.

109
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:44,480
- Huh?
- Ignore her.

110
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:45,880
- Let's go.
- Yeah, right.

111
00:03:45,880 --> 00:03:47,000
We can't go like this.

112
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:48,600
Let's go

113
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:49,480
change our clothes.

114
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,200
Sure, sure.

115
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,240
Let's dress up.

116
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,320
There are so many people.

117
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:02,160
Excuse me, let me through.

118
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:05,560
Wow.

119
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,360
Granny,

120
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,640
you came to join the fun too?

121
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:09,640
What's wrong with being older?

122
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:11,240
Maybe I'm exactly his type.

123
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:11,520
Hmph.

124
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:12,960
That's true.

125
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,480
They say you should always have dreams.

126
00:04:14,480 --> 00:04:15,760
What if it comes true?

127
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:16,160
Right?

128
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:18,480
Oh, Mr. Huang Jr.

129
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:19,480
Come here.

130
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:19,800
Hey!

131
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,120
What are you doing?

132
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:23,640
Oh!

133
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:24,680
Mr. Huang Jr.

134
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,080
Mr. Huang said

135
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:27,320
if you don't choose a bride today,

136
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:28,720
he'll beat me to death!

137
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:30,800
Beat you to death?

138
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:31,960
Yeah.

139
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:32,800
Beat you to death...

140
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:33,800
What does that have to do with me?

141
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:34,640
Hey.

142
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:37,120
I raised you since you were a child.

143
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:39,400
And now you won't help me?

144
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:42,680
You know me.

145
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:45,760
I'm very picky about women.

146
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,000
There's nothing I can do.

147
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:47,960
Oh, come on.

148
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:50,720
Ah!

149
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:51,000
What...

150
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:51,800
What are you doing?

151
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,160
Don't do anything crazy.

152
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:53,760
Today,

153
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:55,160
you must pick a lady.

154
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,800
These are the finest ladies in Lin'an.

155
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,400
You have to pick one today.

156
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:00,120
Fine, fine.

157
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:01,280
Put the knife down first.

158
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:02,280
I...

159
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:04,200
If I can't find someone I like,

160
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:05,840
don't blame me.

161
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:07,520
Seriously?

162
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,000
Yeah.

163
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:08,760
Oh my.

164
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:09,920
As long as you want to pick someone,

165
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,360
I'll thank the heavens.

166
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:12,480
Come, come.

167
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:13,400
Take a look.

168
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:14,480
How about this one?

169
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:18,800
Huh?

170
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:19,360
This...

171
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:20,840
Huh?

172
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:21,880
Wait.

173
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:22,960
You're already pregnant,

174
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,920
why are you here
for a matchmaking event?

175
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:28,040
Mr. Huang wants a grandchild,
doesn't he?

176
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:29,760
I'm already nine months pregnant.

177
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,680
You marry me now,

178
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,360
and he'll have a grandchild next month.

179
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:35,680
Oh my...

180
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:37,120
Thank you for your kindness.

181
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:37,640
But this kind of thing,

182
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:38,960
Mr. Huang Jr. can handle it himself.

183
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:39,920
Next! Next!

184
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:40,640
Hmph.

185
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:46,000
Mrs. Chen,

186
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,480
shouldn't you be resting at home
after giving birth?

187
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,160
Why did you come here to join the fun?

188
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:50,280
Look,

189
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:51,800
I'm here to arrange a marriage
for my daughter.

190
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:52,760
A holy monk said

191
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:54,000
my daughter

192
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:56,080
will be blessed with great fortune.

193
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:57,680
She would be

194
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,240
the perfect match for Mr. Huang Jr.

195
00:05:59,240 --> 00:05:59,760
Oh, come on.

196
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:01,080
By the time your daughter grows up,

197
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,800
I'll already be dead
by Mr. Huang's hand.

198
00:06:03,080 --> 00:06:03,560
Leave. Leave.

199
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,120
Get out of here.

200
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:10,280
Greetings, Mr. Huang Jr.

201
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:11,800
Well.

202
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,840
Hey, Mr. Huang Jr.

203
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,040
How about this one?

204
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:15,440
Huh?

205
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:16,280
Take a look.

206
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:26,120
This...

207
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:26,720
Oh...

208
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,520
You can see the situation.

209
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:29,920
It's not that I don't want to help you,

210
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,160
but today's matchmaking

211
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:32,400
is over.

212
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:33,680
Wait, Mr. Huang Jr., you can't leave!

213
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,400
Don't go!

214
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,600
My goodness.

215
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,680
Her teeth are a little black,

216
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:38,040
and she's a little ugly,

217
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:39,520
but after you marry her,

218
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:40,480
just don't let her talk.

219
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,120
Problem solved.

220
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:45,000
Then I'll buy her

221
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,400
and make her your wife.

222
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,160
How about that?

223
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:48,920
Oh...

224
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:50,920
How did you even do your job?

225
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,360
You brought me nothing but misfits.

226
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,600
Go, go.

227
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:53,960
Get out.

228
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,680
Get out!

229
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:57,080
You too, get out.

230
00:06:57,080 --> 00:06:58,400
What a bunch of weirdos.

231
00:06:58,400 --> 00:06:59,960
You should look at yourselves
in the mirror first.

232
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:00,400
Oh.

233
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,360
Anyone thinks they can come here?

234
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,280
Go, go, go.

235
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:03,320
Go, go.

236
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:03,840
Leave.

237
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:04,280
Go.

238
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:05,920
Why isn't there even one decent girl?

239
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:07,120
Go, go.

240
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,360
Go.

241
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:09,320
Hey...

242
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:10,880
Oh!

243
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:11,440
Ah...

244
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,040
Miss,

245
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,160
- please open your mouth.
- Huh?

246
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:18,760
Huh?

247
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:19,760
Open up.

248
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:20,680
Ah...

249
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:21,480
Oh dear.

250
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:22,880
- Huh?
- Come on, let's go.

251
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:23,560
Come inside with me.

252
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:23,960
Huh?

253
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:24,720
Let's go, let's go.

254
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:24,960
Hey.

255
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:32,560
Mr. Huang Jr.

256
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:33,600
Mr. Huang Jr.

257
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,600
Look!

258
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,520
She's a real beauty!

259
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,080
Hmm.

260
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:38,360
I've never seen such a beautiful woman.

261
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:41,480
And who is this?

262
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:43,280
- I'm her father.
- Uh... he's my brother.

263
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,280
Our parents passed away early.

264
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:50,920
As her brother,

265
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:51,960
I have to be her brother,

266
00:07:51,960 --> 00:07:53,040
and her father too.

267
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:53,760
Right?

268
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:54,880
Right.

269
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:56,560
Jinyin,

270
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:57,840
take this gentleman

271
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:59,720
to the guest room for some food
and rest.

272
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:00,920
Then take this lady

273
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:01,840
to get ready.

274
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:03,160
She'll meet my father later.

275
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,600
Congratulations to you both.

276
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,000
From now on,

277
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:08,840
you'll be our young mistress.

278
00:08:09,400 --> 00:08:10,160
What's the rush?

279
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:12,120
We haven't discussed

280
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,320
the betrothal gifts yet.

281
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:15,120
Betrothal gifts?

282
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:15,600
Right.

283
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,560
That's easy.

284
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:20,160
As long as Mr. Huang agrees,

285
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:22,400
the gifts won't be a problem.

286
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,360
Well...

287
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:34,760
I haven't eaten this well in ages.

288
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:35,560
Oh my...

289
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,160
If I had some wine,

290
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:38,360
it'd be perfect.

291
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,200
Ah...

292
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:40,960
Wow!

293
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:42,040
Wow!

294
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:45,520
I'm only eating vegetables.

295
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:46,680
No meat, no alcohol.

296
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:48,440
Just kidding, just kidding.

297
00:08:58,800 --> 00:09:00,480
Mr. Huang Jr. is truly talented.

298
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:01,560
Amazing, amazing!

299
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:07,320
Oh no...

300
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,880
- What bad luck...
- Holy Monk.

301
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:09,800
What's wrong?

302
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:11,240
Mr. Huang Jr...

303
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:12,680
is a real weirdo.

304
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,480
I'm holding back my curses.

305
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,200
Unbelievable...

306
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:15,520
Hey.

307
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:17,080
What are you doing here?

308
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:19,120
I was worried about you.

309
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:20,920
Where's Piaopiao?

310
00:09:20,920 --> 00:09:21,520
Oh no...

311
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:22,520
I was in a rush and forgot about her.

312
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:23,640
Oh no...

313
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:24,720
I'll go find her.

314
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:26,040
Hey!

315
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:34,480
Mr. Huang Jr. prefers men.

316
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:35,520
Later,

317
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,280
use this appearance

318
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:38,360
to seduce him.

319
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:40,240
Then use your real appearance

320
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,600
to seduce Mr. Huang.

321
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,480
I'll make them

322
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:45,080
turn against each other because of you.

323
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:46,680
Seduce?

324
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,240
But I don't know how.

325
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:49,960
You're a fox spirit.

326
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,760
Seducing people
is your natural instinct.

327
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:53,440
If you can't even seduce them,

328
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:55,240
how will you ever win
your benefactor's heart?

329
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:56,640
But...

330
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,360
If I go there myself,

331
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,760
I can still kill them

332
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,640
and get my revenge.

333
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:07,520
Then your benefactor

334
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:09,680
will spend the rest of his life
in that pagoda.

335
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:12,960
Wait.

336
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:14,960
Fine.

337
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,200
I'll do it.

338
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,760
Help!

339
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,480
Help!

340
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,080
Help!

341
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:26,600
Help!

342
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:27,480
There's a monk!

343
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:28,680
What happened?

344
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:30,800
Father!

345
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,240
There's a monk!

346
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:32,760
What?

347
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:33,400
A monk?

348
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:35,520
Mr. Huang Jr.

349
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,640
(Freedom)

350
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:42,280
(Drizzle on the Heavenly Street)

351
00:10:42,280 --> 00:10:44,040
Mr. Huang Jr.

352
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:47,120
Guards!

353
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:48,720
Beat that man to death!

354
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:49,080
Yes, sir.

355
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:49,480
Hey!

356
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:53,360
Don't hit my face!

357
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:03,120
- You...
- Stop hitting me.

358
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:04,400
Now,

359
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:05,600
take my son

360
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:07,120
and have him consummate the marriage
with the girl he chose.

361
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:07,880
What?

362
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:08,640
Don't hit my face!

363
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:09,760
But, Mr. Huang,

364
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,960
she hasn't even married
into the family yet.

365
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:13,280
She's waiting in the guest room

366
00:11:13,280 --> 00:11:14,640
to discuss the betrothal gifts with you.

367
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:15,360
Nonsense!

368
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,000
Betrothal gifts?

369
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,760
If she marries into my family,

370
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:19,280
I'll feed her

371
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:20,000
and put a roof over her head.

372
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:21,640
It's already generous that I don't
ask her for money.

373
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:22,760
Yes, yes.

374
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:25,000
Ever since I came to Lin'an,

375
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,480
many people here

376
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:28,240
can't even afford food.

377
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:30,240
Marrying into my family

378
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:31,560
is her good fortune.

379
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:32,760
And she wants money?

380
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,840
I'll slap you if you keep talking!

381
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:35,760
Yes, yes.

382
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:36,360
Yes.

383
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:37,360
Father.

384
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:40,160
I'll consummate the marriage
if you want.

385
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,320
However,

386
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:43,800
you have to agree
to my previous conditions.

387
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:44,280
Pah.

388
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:47,840
You're in no position to bargain
with me!

389
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:50,480
- Tonight,
- Yes?

390
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:51,840
if he doesn't consummate the marriage,

391
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:53,640
kill this disobedient son of mine.

392
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,360
What?

393
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:54,880
Then,

394
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:56,280
I'll avenge you

395
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:58,120
and kill her.

396
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:58,800
You two,

397
00:11:59,080 --> 00:11:59,720
handle it yourselves.

398
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,000
- Hey!
- Father!

399
00:12:01,520 --> 00:12:02,400
- Father!
- Mr. Huang!

400
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:03,760
Oh my...

401
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:05,120
Mr. Huang Jr.

402
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:05,960
You heard him.

403
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:08,360
Please bear with it.

404
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:11,520
Oh my...

405
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:12,720
Mr. Huang Jr.

406
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,960
Do you really want to watch me die?

407
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:17,320
You've served my family for years.

408
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,240
You know

409
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:19,520
things like this

410
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:20,520
can't be forced.

411
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:20,840
Hey.

412
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,160
However,

413
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:28,080
the monk just escaped,

414
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:31,240
and I have all this passion
with nowhere to go.

415
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,520
So this girl is lucky.

416
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:34,240
Let's go.

417
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:35,600
Go.

418
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:36,400
Go.

419
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:42,120
Piaopiao.

420
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,200
Useless.

421
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:57,560
Looks like

422
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,760
I'll have to do it myself.

423
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:03,920
Hmm.

424
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:08,000
Where did those people go?

425
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:09,880
Hmm.

426
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:13,120
- Piaopiao.
- Yes?

427
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:15,000
Mr. Huang Jr. is coming to consummate
the marriage with you!

428
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,160
He hasn't paid us yet.

429
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:17,960
What marriage?

430
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:18,800
No.

431
00:13:18,880 --> 00:13:20,520
Mr. Huang is trying
to force things through first.

432
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:20,960
What?

433
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:22,000
Yes!

434
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:23,880
(Where is that young lady?)

435
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:25,440
(She's in the room.)

436
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:27,560
D-Don't be scared.

437
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:29,240
If they dare try anything,

438
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:31,320
I'll kill them.

439
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:32,240
Oh.

440
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:34,400
(Put your knife away first.)

441
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:35,000
(Stop wasting time.)

442
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,360
(Go in.)

443
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:38,200
I ate too many oranges,
and my stomach hurts.

444
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:39,240
Cover for me first.

445
00:13:39,640 --> 00:13:40,120
Ah!

446
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:52,960
Who are you?

447
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:55,280
Where is my young mistress?

448
00:13:55,280 --> 00:13:56,080
I...

449
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:58,360
I'm her younger sister.

450
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,360
She... she...

451
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,320
went to the bathroom.

452
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:02,480
In this world,

453
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:04,720
there is actually such a lovely woman.

454
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:06,640
You, get out.

455
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:08,360
Don't interrupt my business.

456
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:10,120
Mr. Huang Jr.

457
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:11,880
I'll guard outside the door.

458
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:13,520
If you don't consummate the marriage,

459
00:14:13,920 --> 00:14:15,040
I will fight you to the death.

460
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:16,360
Enough nonsense.

461
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,200
Get out now!

462
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:19,640
- Go.
- Go.

463
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:27,400
Miss.

464
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:29,320
I'm coming.

465
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:37,640
My family may be celebrating
a wedding soon.

466
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:40,040
This is your favorite human blood.

467
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:41,280
Drink it quickly.

468
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:43,360
Spit out more gold for me.

469
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:49,520
Today, I want to try a different flavor.

470
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:51,560
I'll drink your blood!

471
00:14:57,280 --> 00:15:00,320
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

472
00:15:00,680 --> 00:15:03,520
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

473
00:15:03,640 --> 00:15:07,320
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

474
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:10,400
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

475
00:15:10,800 --> 00:15:14,360
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

476
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:17,560
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

477
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:21,120
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

478
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:31,040
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

479
00:15:31,040 --> 00:15:34,280
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

480
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:37,600
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

481
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:39,280
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

482
00:15:39,280 --> 00:15:41,200
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

483
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:42,760
♪I left my wife behind♪

484
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:44,360
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

485
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:48,200
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

486
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,320
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

487
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:51,440
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

488
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:53,120
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

489
00:15:53,120 --> 00:15:55,000
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

490
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:58,360
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

491
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:01,640
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

492
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:04,760
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

493
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:08,120
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

494
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:11,800
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

495
00:16:11,800 --> 00:16:15,160
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

496
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:18,240
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

497
00:16:18,800 --> 00:16:21,880
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

498
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:25,320
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

499
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:28,880
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

500
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:32,360
♪You're just wasting your time♪

501
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:35,320
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

502
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:37,000
♪And I just laugh happily♪

503
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:40,400
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

504
